		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Wingless, nigh-albino dragon with two arms. Appears sickly and gaunt, relishes devouring undead.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +7 (2d8) and 2 claws +7 (2d6) or 1 entropic breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Curse</strong>. When slain, death curses the slayer. WIS 15+ or age 1 year per day.</p><p></p><p><strong>Entropic Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from linnorm. CON 15+ or 3d8 damage and 1d6 STR damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
